        "id": "passive",
        "name": "Athame Artis · passive",
        "source": "Weapon",
        "category": "weapon",
        "defaultEnabled": true,
        "description": "CRIT DMG from Elemental Bursts is increased by 16%/20%/24%/28%/32%. When an Elemental Burst hits an opponent, gain the Blade of the Daylight Hours effect: ATK is increased by 20%/25%/30%/35%/40%. Nearby active party members other than the equipping character have their ATK increased by 16%/20%/24%/28%/32% for 3s.Additionally, when the party possesses Hexerei: Secret Rite effects, the effects of Blade of the Daylight Hours are increased by an additional 75%. This effect can be triggered even if the equipping character is off-field. Combat snapshot: set the controls for this hit; durations, stack consumption, healing, energy and cooldowns are not simulated.",
